  <History Date="15-07-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Thor CANLU 9R Plus (channel overview title says 20 channels but only 18 listed.  frost ranges are for prism - set as raw for now.  lamp on and off ranges identical - used 200-205 for on)" Version="1" />
